<p>The <code>DoListItem</code> is one tip inside a
  <a href="/components/do-list/"><code>DoList</code></a>. It renders
  an <code>&lt;li&gt;</code>; the example CSS adds a green tick via
  a <code>::before</code> pseudo-element.</p>

<p>See the <a href="/components/do-list/">DoList demo</a> for the
  composed example.</p>

{# BEGIN generated: examples (bin/generate-examples) #}
<h2>Usage</h2>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>{% raw %}&lt;DoList heading="Do"&gt;
  &lt;DoListItem&gt;cover blisters that are likely to burst with a soft plaster or dressing&lt;/DoListItem&gt;
  &lt;DoListItem&gt;wash your hands before touching a burst blister&lt;/DoListItem&gt;
  &lt;DoListItem&gt;allow the fluid in a burst blister to drain before covering it with a plaster or dressing&lt;/DoListItem&gt;
&lt;/DoList&gt;
{% endraw %}</code></pre>
